        "imgDesc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "In Nod-Krai, numerous objects coexist with kuuvahki energy. Under the influence of the Pillar of Embla, these objects, when combined with pure kuuvahki energy, can be <color=#ffe14b>absorbed</color> or <color=#ffe14b>thrown</color> ."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "Page 2/3",
        "img": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/01/12/a82b5d09ead80cc54e2c179496345109_2411166991148405027.png",
        "imgDesc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffe14b>Hold to aim</color> and throw an absorbed object in any direction while maintaining the absorption state..."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "Page 3/3",
        "img": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/01/12/4326dc28a953df2a27b5bbde1ab9406b_5753359053900486851.png",
        "imgDesc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "Of course, you may also <color=#ffe14b>Tap to release</color> and put it down. Doing so will cause you to lose the power granted by the kuuvahki energy."
          }
        ]
      }
